CHECK:UNNECESSARY_PARENTHESES: Unnecessary parentheses around 'env->migration_type == migrate_task'
#103: FILE: kernel/sched/fair.c:9510:
+	if ((env->migration_type == migrate_task) &&
+		(sd->nr_balance_failed > sd->cache_nice_tries+2))

Parentheses are not required in the following cases:

  1. Function pointer uses::

      (foo->bar)();

    could be::

      foo->bar();

  2. Comparisons in if::

      if ((foo->bar) && (foo->baz))
      if ((foo == bar))

    could be::

      if (foo->bar && foo->baz)
      if (foo == bar)

  3. addressof/dereference single Lvalues::

      &(foo->bar)
      *(foo->bar)

    could be::

      &foo->bar
      *foo->bar

